  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "SURVIVE A VIRTUAL WORLD Battle your way through unique and beautiful locations. Packed with challenge monsters and enormous bosses bent on taking you out, don’t give them the satisfaction! Pick one of six characters each with unique abilities and battle styles! PLAY SOLO OR CO-OP Challenge yourself by taking on enemies alone, or with up to four of your friends online and battle cooperatively!",
    "zh-Hant": "在虛擬的世界中活下來 探索不同的世界，每一個地區都會有具有挑戰的怪物與首領，無止盡的追殺你 不斷地打敗他們並逃脫出這個輪迴 蒐集強大的物品 蒐集的物品越多，效果就越強大，不同的物品組合起來可能會有意想不到的效果 獨自冒險或連線闖關 可以獨自在世界裡探索，也可以與最多四個朋友一同連線過關",
    "zh-Hans": "QQ交流群： 1群：548484180 2群：1035311620 在虚拟的世界中活下来 探索不同的世界，每一个地区都会有具有挑战的怪物与首领，无止尽的追杀你 不断地打败他们并逃脱出这个轮迴 蒐集强大的物品 蒐集的物品越多，效果就越强大，不同的物品组合起来可能会有意想不到的效果 独自冒险或连线闯关 可以独自在世界里探索，也可以与最多四个朋友一同连线过关",
    "ja": "SURVIVE A VIRTUAL WORLD 手作りされたいくつかの美しいロケールが待っており、それぞれにあなたの存続を妨げる手強いモンスターや巨大なボスが詰め込まれています。 最後のボスまで戦い、脱出してください。 DISCOVER POWERFUL ITEMS 収集するアイテムの数が増えるほど、それらの効果の組み合わせが増え、その組み合わせの中にはより驚くべきものも含まれる可能性があります。 PLAY SOLO OR CO-OP ソロで、またはオンライン協力プレイで最大 4 人の友達と一緒に冒険に挑みましょう。",
    "ko": "가상세계에서 살아남기 서로 다른 세계를 탐험하면, 각 지역마다 도전적인 괴물과 우두머리들이 당신을 끝없이 쫓고, 끊임없이 그들을 물리치고 이 라운드에서 탈출한다. 강력한 물품을 수집하다 물건을 많이 모으면 모을수록 효과가 커지며, 물건별로 조합하면 의도하지 않은 효과가 있을 수 있다. 혼자서 모험을 하거나 연결을 통해 관문을 돌파한다 혼자서 세계를 탐험할 수도 있고 최대 4명의 친구와 함께 연결해서 통과할 수도 있다."
  },
  "detailed_descriptions_html": {
    "en": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE A VIRTUAL WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/c075679faa04c411865856fe589fc47b.poster.avif?t=1778924506\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/c075679faa04c411865856fe589fc47b.webm?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/c075679faa04c411865856fe589fc47b.mp4?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Battle your way through unique and beautiful locations. Packed with challenge monsters and enormous bosses bent on taking you out, don’t give them the satisfaction!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/924d5d1f1afe55411bcf4d555700a9b9.webp?t=1778924506\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/924d5d1f1afe55411bcf4d555700a9b9.poster.avif?t=1778924506\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=252 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick one of six characters each with unique abilities and battle styles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/cfe6f8fc5369b42aff93709cc14b22e5.avif?t=1778924506\" width=615 height=220 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY SOLO OR CO-OP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself by taking on enemies alone, or with up to four of your friends online and battle cooperatively!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/25a6b63b7691fd7a276d02c1251a5e4a.poster.avif?t=1778924506\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/25a6b63b7691fd7a276d02c1251a5e4a.webm?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/25a6b63b7691fd7a276d02c1251a5e4a.mp4?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/bb93532c47788492856d1f69306d0c8b.poster.avif?t=1778924506\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/bb93532c47788492856d1f69306d0c8b.webm?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/bb93532c47788492856d1f69306d0c8b.mp4?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "zh-Hant": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >在虛擬的世界中活下來</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >探索不同的世界，每一個地區都會有具有挑戰的怪物與首領，無止盡的追殺你</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >不斷地打敗他們並逃脫出這個輪迴</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/289feb27854bed8d3f0a12ffe6135538.poster.avif?t=1778924506\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/289feb27854bed8d3f0a12ffe6135538.webm?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/289feb27854bed8d3f0a12ffe6135538.mp4?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/c5096572a7955d912723e1b6c8119e57.poster.avif?t=1778924506\" width=616 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/c5096572a7955d912723e1b6c8119e57.webm?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/c5096572a7955d912723e1b6c8119e57.mp4?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >蒐集強大的物品</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >蒐集的物品越多，效果就越強大，不同的物品組合起來可能會有意想不到的效果</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/99112fd4eb28002f801aa1f753754dc3.poster.avif?t=1778924506\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/99112fd4eb28002f801aa1f753754dc3.webm?t=1778924506\"