    "ja": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE A VIRTUAL WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >手作りされたいくつかの美しいロケールが待っており、それぞれにあなたの存続を妨げる手強いモンスターや巨大なボスが詰め込まれています。 最後のボスまで戦い、脱出してください。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/289feb27854bed8d3f0a12ffe6135538.poster.avif?t=1778924506\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/289feb27854bed8d3f0a12ffe6135538.webm?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/289feb27854bed8d3f0a12ffe6135538.mp4?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/c5096572a7955d912723e1b6c8119e57.poster.avif?t=1778924506\" width=616 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/c5096572a7955d912723e1b6c8119e57.webm?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/c5096572a7955d912723e1b6c8119e57.mp4?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER POWERFUL ITEMS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >収集するアイテムの数が増えるほど、それらの効果の組み合わせが増え、その組み合わせの中にはより驚くべきものも含まれる可能性があります。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/99112fd4eb28002f801aa1f753754dc3.poster.avif?t=1778924506\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/99112fd4eb28002f801aa1f753754dc3.webm?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/99112fd4eb28002f801aa1f753754dc3.mp4?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/ede7adb8ac18043c1930c9b6c2850192.poster.avif?t=1778924506\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/ede7adb8ac18043c1930c9b6c2850192.webm?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/ede7adb8ac18043c1930c9b6c2850192.mp4?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/f2f4275001dc4f5a21d6660a549c9a0e.poster.avif?t=1778924506\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/f2f4275001dc4f5a21d6660a549c9a0e.webm?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/f2f4275001dc4f5a21d6660a549c9a0e.mp4?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY SOLO OR CO-OP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ソロで、またはオンライン協力プレイで最大 4 人の友達と一緒に冒険に挑みましょう。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/c075679faa04c411865856fe589fc47b.poster.avif?t=1778924506\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/c075679faa04c411865856fe589fc47b.webm?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/c075679faa04c411865856fe589fc47b.mp4?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "ko": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >가상세계에서 살아남기</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >서로 다른 세계를 탐험하면, 각 지역마다 도전적인 괴물과 우두머리들이 당신을 끝없이 쫓고, 끊임없이 그들을 물리치고 이 라운드에서 탈출한다.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/289feb27854bed8d3f0a12ffe6135538.poster.avif?t=1778924506\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/289feb27854bed8d3f0a12ffe6135538.webm?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/289feb27854bed8d3f0a12ffe6135538.mp4?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/c5096572a7955d912723e1b6c8119e57.poster.avif?t=1778924506\" width=616 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/c5096572a7955d912723e1b6c8119e57.webm?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/c5096572a7955d912723e1b6c8119e57.mp4?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >강력한 물품을 수집하다</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >물건을 많이 모으면 모을수록 효과가 커지며, 물건별로 조합하면 의도하지 않은 효과가 있을 수 있다.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/99112fd4eb28002f801aa1f753754dc3.poster.avif?t=1778924506\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/99112fd4eb28002f801aa1f753754dc3.webm?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/99112fd4eb28002f801aa1f753754dc3.mp4?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/25a6b63b7691fd7a276d02c1251a5e4a.poster.avif?t=1778924506\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/25a6b63b7691fd7a276d02c1251a5e4a.webm?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/25a6b63b7691fd7a276d02c1251a5e4a.mp4?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/bb93532c47788492856d1f69306d0c8b.poster.avif?t=1778924506\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/bb93532c47788492856d1f69306d0c8b.webm?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/bb93532c47788492856d1f69306d0c8b.mp4?t=1778924506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >혼자서 모험을 하거나 연결을 통해 관문을 돌파한다</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >혼자서 세계를 탐험할 수도 있고 최대 4명의 친구와 함께 연결해서 통과할 수도 있다.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/c075679faa04c411865856fe589fc47b.poster.a